// and the value is [Русский, Тоҷикӣ, English, Türkçe].
// A "|context" suffix lets one Uzbek word have different translations (it is stripped in Uzbek).
// {name} placeholders are filled by t(key, { name: … }).
// TypeScript enforces that every t("…") key exists here and that every entry has all 4 translations.

